# POXY-GEN1 (POXY WORLD by AETRYX LTD)

Read `CLAUDE.md` first, every session. It is the agent entrypoint: docs map,
zone locations, workflow rules, safety lines.

Zone rules live in `.cursor/rules/`:
- 00-global.mdc  — law for every session (glossary, commits, safety)
- 10-web.mdc     — apps/web + packages (Sky DS, vanilla TS, mobile-first)
- 20-supabase.mdc — migrations only, RLS everywhere, edge function law
- 30-mcu.mdc     — apps/mcu is hands-off unless declared

Non-negotiable: one zone per session; commit per phase to a feature branch
(never straight to main); DB via migrations only; every balance change
through the ledger; crypto server-side; rarity colors only in gems/badges;
glossary terms only; 18+/limits/self-exclusion server-enforced.

The prototype-era rule set is archived in `archive/cursor-rules-v1/`.
